title: Bank Vault
text: Light that enters a TELEPORTER jumps ahead to the next teleporter in the direction it is travelling, and carries on from there. Get the light into the vault without breaking a wall.
trick: a fixed teleporter pair jumps the beam through the vault wall; only light travelling the right way finds the inside one
motif: walled vault with the gold inside
---
